{"seq":2,"slug":"partial-dependence","title":"部分依赖与 ICE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/global-methods/partial-dependence","wordCount":1667,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"部分依赖与-ice\">部分依赖与 ICE</h1><p><a href=\"feature-importance\">特征重要性</a>告诉你「年龄」很重要，但它对风险评分到底是越大越高、越大越低、还是先升后降？排名表回答不了「形状」问题。部分依赖图（PDP）和个体条件期望（ICE）就是用来画出这条形状曲线的——它们让你看到一个特征在整个取值范围上如何驱动预测，而不是只给一个标量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>部分依赖系列回答的是「形状」问题：某个特征如何整体影响预测。三个方法的递进关系，本质上是在不断修补同一个假设的漏洞。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PDP</strong>：把目标特征固定到一组网格值、对其余特征按数据分布求平均（边际化），得到对平均预测的边际效应曲线。</li>\n<li><strong>ICE</strong>：不取平均，为每个样本单独画一条曲线，暴露 PDP 会抹掉的个体异质性与交互效应。</li>\n<li><strong>ALE</strong>：在小区间内只对落入该区间的样本计算预测的局部变化再累加，避免 PDP 制造分布外样本。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>处理相关特征</th>\n<th>暴露个体异质性</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PDP</td>\n<td>1 条平均曲线</td>\n<td>差（制造 OOD 样本）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ICE</td>\n<td>n 条个体曲线</td>\n<td>同 PDP</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中—高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALE</td>\n<td>1 条累积曲线</td>\n<td>好（局部差分）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条边界必须记住：PDP 的致命假设是目标特征与其余特征独立，相关时曲线失真；同时 PDP 是关联曲线，不能读成因果曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分依赖的定义\">部分依赖的定义</h2><p>部分依赖图把目标特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 固定到一系列网格值，对其余所有特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按数据分布求平均（边际化掉），得到目标特征对平均预测的边际效应。形式上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PD</mtext><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PD}_S(x_S) = \\mathbb{E}_{x_C}\\big[\\hat{f}(x_S, x_C)\\big] \\approx \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\hat{f}\\big(x_S, x_C^{(i)}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3079em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2503em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实现上很直接：对每个网格值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，把数据集里所有样本的目标列都强制改成这个值、其余列保持原样，让模型预测，再把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个预测取平均。扫完整个网格，连起来就是 PDP 曲线。它能画一维（单特征）也能画二维（两特征的交互热力图）。</p>\n<p>PDP 的最大优点是直观——曲线的走向和拐点一目了然，单调性、阈值效应都看得出来。但它有一个致命假设：被边际化的特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与目标特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <strong>相互独立</strong>。当它们相关时，强制把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设成某个值、其余列不动，会制造出现实中根本不存在的样本组合（比如「怀孕」=是 且「性别」=男），模型在这些分布外的点上的预测毫无意义，PDP 曲线随之失真。这个「在分布外做评估」的问题，是<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls\">陷阱与误读</a>一篇的核心警告之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ice-把平均拆回个体\">ICE：把平均拆回个体</h2><p>PDP 是一条平均曲线，而平均会撒谎。考虑一个特征对一半样本是正效应、对另一半是等量负效应——PDP 会画出一条平坦的水平线，让你误以为这个特征没用，实际上它对每个个体都强烈影响，只是方向相反互相抵消了。</p>\n<p>ICE（Individual Conditional Expectation）就是解药：不取平均，而是为<strong>每一个样本</strong>单独画一条曲线。把目标特征扫过网格，每个样本得到一条自己的预测曲线，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个样本就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条线。PDP 其实就是所有 ICE 曲线的逐点平均。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    D[数据集 n 个样本] --&gt; G[在目标特征上取网格值]&#10;    G --&gt; P[每个样本×每个网格值&lt;br/&gt;强制改目标列后预测]&#10;    P --&gt; ICE[n 条 ICE 曲线&lt;br/&gt;暴露个体异质性]&#10;    P --&gt; AVG[逐点取平均]&#10;    AVG --&gt; PDP[1 条 PDP 曲线&lt;br/&gt;边际平均效应]&#10;    ICE --&gt; H{曲线是否平行}&#10;    H --&gt;|平行| NoInter[无交互·PDP 可信]&#10;    H --&gt;|发散/交叉| Inter[存在交互·只看 PDP 会误导]\">flowchart TD\n    D[数据集 n 个样本] --&gt; G[在目标特征上取网格值]\n    G --&gt; P[每个样本×每个网格值&lt;br/&gt;强制改目标列后预测]\n    P --&gt; ICE[n 条 ICE 曲线&lt;br/&gt;暴露个体异质性]\n    P --&gt; AVG[逐点取平均]\n    AVG --&gt; PDP[1 条 PDP 曲线&lt;br/&gt;边际平均效应]\n    ICE --&gt; H{曲线是否平行}\n    H --&gt;|平行| NoInter[无交互·PDP 可信]\n    H --&gt;|发散/交叉| Inter[存在交互·只看 PDP 会误导]</pre><p>读 ICE 图有个诀窍：如果所有 ICE 曲线大致平行，说明目标特征的效应不随其他特征变化，此时 PDP 是可信的概括；如果曲线明显发散甚至交叉，说明存在交互效应，光看 PDP 会掩盖异质性。常用的「中心化 ICE（c-ICE）」把每条曲线在起点对齐，更容易看出形状差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ale-相关特征下的修正\">ALE：相关特征下的修正</h2><p>PDP 在特征相关时失真，累积局部效应（ALE，Accumulated Local Effects）是为此设计的替代品。它不强行把目标特征设成全局网格值，而是在每个小区间内、只对落在该区间的样本计算预测的<strong>局部变化量</strong>，再沿区间累加。因为只在数据真实存在的局部邻域里做差分，它避免了制造分布外样本，因此在特征相关时比 PDP 更可靠。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>处理相关特征</th>\n<th>暴露个体异质性</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PDP</td>\n<td>1 条平均曲线</td>\n<td>差（制造 OOD 样本）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ICE</td>\n<td>n 条个体曲线</td>\n<td>同 PDP</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中—高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALE</td>\n<td>1 条累积曲线</td>\n<td>好（局部差分）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实务建议：默认同时画 PDP + ICE（一张图叠加），用 ICE 检查异质性、用 PDP 看总体趋势；当你知道特征间相关性强时，改用或加画 ALE。</p>\n<h2 id=\"和其他方法的位置\">和其他方法的位置</h2><p>部分依赖系列填补了一个特定空缺：它在<a href=\"feature-importance\">特征重要性</a>（只给标量排名）和<a href=\"../local-methods/\">局部方法</a>（只看单样本）之间，给出「某个特征如何整体影响预测」的形状视角。它和<a href=\"../foundations/intrinsic-vs-posthoc\">内在可解释模型</a>里 GAM/EBM 的形状函数概念上极其接近——区别在于 GAM 的形状曲线是模型结构本身（天然忠实），而 PDP 是对黑箱事后估计出来的（受独立性假设拖累）。这也是为什么如果你用了 EBM，往往不再需要单独画 PDP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个常见误读\">一个常见误读</h2><p>PDP 曲线极易被读成因果曲线：「把年龄从 30 提到 40，风险会按这条曲线上升」。这是错的。PDP 描述的是模型学到的关联，不是干预的因果效应。除非你的特征确实满足因果可识别的条件，否则不能把 PDP 的横轴当成可以「拨动」的干预旋钮。这个相关—因果的混淆，连同分布外评估，构成了<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls\">陷阱与误读</a>里关于全局方法最危险的两个坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PDP 把目标特征固定到网格、对其余特征求平均，画出对平均预测的边际效应曲线。</li>\n<li>PDP 假设目标特征与其余特征独立，相关时会制造分布外样本导致曲线失真。</li>\n<li>ICE 为每个样本单独画曲线，暴露 PDP 平均会抹掉的个体异质性与交互效应。</li>\n<li>ALE 用局部区间差分替代全局网格，在特征相关时比 PDP 更可靠。</li>\n<li>PDP/ICE 是关联曲线不是因果曲线，且与 GAM/EBM 的形状函数概念相通但忠实性来源不同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"部分依赖与 ICE","id":"部分依赖与-ice"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"部分依赖的定义","id":"部分依赖的定义"},{"level":2,"text":"ICE：把平均拆回个体","id":"ice-把平均拆回个体"},{"level":2,"text":"ALE：相关特征下的修正","id":"ale-相关特征下的修正"},{"level":2,"text":"和其他方法的位置","id":"和其他方法的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"一个常见误读","id":"一个常见误读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特征重要性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/global-methods/feature-importance"},"next":{"title":"代理模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/global-methods/surrogate-models"}}